day in Montgomery, Alabama.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:34.420
I swear the sun is so hot I nearly melted.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:37.510
- Indeed, Dr. King, but I
suspect we didn't meet here

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:38.810
to talk about the weather.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.840
- Indeed, brother Malcolm.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:45.320
Unless, of course, we articulate

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:49.230
that the sun in the country
shines brighter on some

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.913
than it does on others.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.900
- Yes, but when the sun does shine on us

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:02.548
it is growing the seeds of revolution.

00:01:02.548 --> 00:01:05.215
- That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.060
- I see your point, brother Malcolm,

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:15.060
but do not those same seeds
need to be watered with love?

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:20.480
- [Key] Well, I suppose
that is the subject

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.583
of some discussion, Dr. King.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:29.150
- And I am all for
discussion, brother Malcolm,

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:31.720
unless of course the words devolve

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:34.476
into proclamations of hate.

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:36.850
(audience applauding)

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:41.850
- Well, is that not why we
are here today, Dr. King?

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:46.083
To discuss.
(fly buzzing)

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.110
- Yes, brother Malcolm.

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:55.900
And I am confident that as we discuss-

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.200
- We are going to
discuss it and discuss it

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:03.360
until I say

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.193
that

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.850
our people have never resorted to violence

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.900
before the white man gave them no choice

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.027
but to pay him back in the
only currency he understands.

00:02:16.027 --> 00:02:19.194
(audience applauding)

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.393
- Brother Malcolm,

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:27.570
is that what you really
have to say at this point

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:28.880
