00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:31.090
- Indeed, Dr. King.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.460
Because we didn't land on Plymouth Rock.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:39.460
Plymouth Rock landed on us!
(audience cheering)

00:02:44.157 --> 00:02:46.110
- Okay, well yes, all right.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:48.060
I've heard you say that before.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.580
I don't know why we're talking about rocks

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:56.480
when in fact it is the flesh
and the bone and the dreams.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.480
I have a dream that someday
our children will be judged

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.120
by the content of their character,

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.559
not by the color of their skin.

00:03:04.559 --> 00:03:07.970
(audience applauding)

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.420
- Same for me, same for me.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:12.610
In fact, I believe that
one day a black man

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:15.477
will become the president of
the United States of America.

00:03:15.477 --> 00:03:17.100
(audience applauding)

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:20.289
Hopefully for eight years.
(audience cheering)

00:03:20.289 --> 00:03:25.289
Obama 2020.
(audience cheering)

00:03:25.817 --> 00:03:27.660
- Of course eight years,
of course eight years.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.310
That's a given, right?

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.718
That's a given.

00:03:30.718 --> 00:03:32.770
But in order to get there,

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.910
